# Small extras measured on top of candidate 1 (p50 ms vs same-session control 16.6): smrt4 -0.3, skyslice -0.1, cld256 -0.1, vsmmov -0.1 (each within ~0.2 ms of noise
# alone; kept together because they only touch shadow-ray count, sky-capture cadence, cloud sample cap and moving-view shadow resolution).
r.Shadow.Virtual.SMRT.RayCountDirectional=4
r.SkyLight.RealTimeReflectionCapture.TimeSlice=1
r.VolumetricCloud.ViewRaySampleMaxCount=256
r.Shadow.Virtual.ResolutionLodBiasDirectionalMoving=1
